      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAVE IGNITION (4) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 1.3 lengths (19.94) behind Tea Rose at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from eight starts. Leading chance again. VELOCITY YIN (1) was unfavoured last start but gave a huge sight when led for much of the way to place (19.39) at Q Straight in a P5 over 350m. Will give a great sight again. NANA MARIE (8) had been racing well with a Mix 5 win three back then placed next time before missing the frame latest at this track. Expected to do much better this time. LOVE'S A MEMORY (3) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
